Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat(mcp): set_tool_holder and list_holder_library

Set a tool's holder from the built-in library (gauge_len, projection),
a drawn spun profile, or clear it - through SetToolBody, one undo step;
get_job shows each tool's holder. Bad input is refused by name.

Fixes #799

